### Admin Login
POST {{base-url}}/users/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin",
  "password": "adminSecret"
}
> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Create test document type
POST {{base-url}}/types/write
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 0,
  "subType": 0,
  "name": "Tool Definition",
  "description": "These documents describe a tool's function and its incoming and outgoing document types."
}


### List document types
GET {{base-url}}/types/list
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}